@startuml View Ingredient Categories Sequence Diagram
title UC05 - View Ingredient Categories List

actor "Staff/Manager" as User
participant "Ingredient\nCategories Page" as Frontend
participant ":ingredientRoutes" as Routes
participant ":ingredientController" as Controller
participant ":ingredientService" as Service
participant "IngredientCategory\nModel" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: 1. Click "Ingredient Categories"\non Sidebar

Frontend -> Routes: 2. GET /api/ingredient-categories\n?page=1&limit=10\n(Bearer Token)

ref over Routes, Controller
    SSD - Verify JWT Token
end ref

Routes -> Routes: 3. Check Token

opt [Authentication / Authorization failed]
    Routes --> Frontend: 3.1 JSON Error
    Frontend --> User: 3.2 Redirect to Login
end

Routes -> Controller: 4. getAllIngredientCategories(req, res)

Controller -> Service: 5. getAllIngredientCategories\n(queryParams, canteenId)

Service -> Model: 6. paginatedQuery(Model, queryParams,\n{ baseFilter: { canteenId } })

Model -> DB: 7. find({ canteenId })\n.skip().limit().sort()

DB --> Model: 8. Categories list

Model -> DB: 9. countDocuments({ canteenId })

DB --> Model: 10. Total count

Model --> Service: 11. { data: [...], pagination: {...} }

Service --> Controller: 12. Return result

Controller --> Routes: 13. HTTP 200 Response

Routes --> Frontend: 14. JSON Response\n{ success: true, data: [...], pagination: {...} }

Frontend -> Frontend: 15. setState: items, pagination\nRender Table

Frontend --> User: 16. Display list of\ningredient categories\n(with pagination)

opt [User changes page or page size]
    User -> Frontend: 17. Click page 2 or change page size
    Frontend -> Routes: 18. GET /api/ingredient-categories\n?page=2&limit=10
    ref over Routes, Frontend
        Repeat flow from step 3
    end ref
    Frontend --> User: 19. Display updated list
end

@enduml
